MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ParenTest_TestParen
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ParenTest_TestParen [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 2

MOVE TEMP 2 3

MOVE TEMP 3 4

MOVE TEMP 4 TIMES PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2 TEMP 3

PRINT TEMP 4

MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES TEMP 2 TEMP 3

PRINT TEMP 4

MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TIMES PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2 TEMP 3 10

PRINT TEMP 4

RETURN 0
END

